      "uid": "zhcn:b258893b5502d3993ebd4d31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员经常说我很有精神，\r\n那是因为我从大家那里得到了许多应援和心意――",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ac901d021d47fe98b1d92171a8cc031341000e3bff475f3f9eaa39813f919a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
