      "source_text": "姆姆姆姆～～嗯……！！　收集暖暖的心意！！\r\n精神、精神、精神～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69c2bc1f017aafa1b1650fd0f2567a97c92561f949654ac1ec21a04596d8848",
